WEBVTT

00:08:57.316 --> 00:09:00.323
you can also use the microphone.

00:09:00.323 --> 00:09:04.307
Here's an example of a project using the microphone.

00:09:04.307 --> 00:09:06.707
So I'm going to let all of you control this game

00:09:06.707 --> 00:09:08.953
using your voices.

00:09:08.953 --> 00:09:25.409
(Crickets chirping) (Shouts) (Chomping)

00:09:25.409 --> 00:09:34.038
(Laughter)